body:
The distributed `agent-builder` agent template `opencode-suite/agents/agent-builder.md` (product source embedded via `include_str!` in `rust.apg.install`'s `AGENTS` table and installed by `apg init` into `~/.opencode/agents/`). Surfaces it carries:
(a) its own frontmatter `bash:` grants `git add *`/`git commit *` alongside the read-only git patterns, which are EXACT (`git status *`, `git log *`, `git branch --show-current`, `git remote -v`, `git remote show *`, `git ls-files *`) and never the blanket `git branch *`/`git remote *` — their option/subcommand surface admits ref-writing (`git branch -f`/`-D`/`-m`) and config-mutating (`git remote add`/`remove`/`set-url`) forms the agent-builder does not need; rule 2 permits add+commit (push/tag human-approved), and the body states it scaffolds/updates `.opencode/agents/**` on the main checkout and commits there;
(b) the push/tag policy: the ONLY generated agent granted push/tag is the optional `release-agent` (as `ask`);
(c) worktree-write-scope (`requirements.requirement.code-writer-worktree-only-writes`): the "Worktree mirroring (MANDATORY)" bullet and rule 10 become ROLE-AWARE — generated CODE-WRITERS (implementer, `*-implementer`, `test-implementer`) are granted write globs ONLY under `apg/.worktrees/*/` (root paths not granted; mirrored denies stay); the agent-builder keeps its main `.opencode/agents/**` grant; the `release-agent` gets main-checkout release-artefact grants with NO worktree mirror, its set derived by the agent-builder's per-repo analysis and confirmed in the coordinator interview (no fixed list).

Deliberately a NARROW owner, distinct from `solution.component.navigator-prompt-guidance` (both prompt files, realised-by `domain.entity.graph-first-navigation`) and from `solution.component.agent-fs-permission-grants` (this same file, the fs-tool grant rules): `rust.apg.plan_cmd.verify.coverage_check` then maps coverage 1:1 to the edited file. Product source in `solution.container.opencode-suite`; the repo's own `.opencode/agents/**` are consumer artifacts never edited by a change-set.

implemented-by: `opencode-suite/agents/agent-builder.md`.
